  "title": "Dominion Energy Completes Restoration Work at Lake Murray Dam",
  "summary": "200-Foot Boat Exclusion Zone Will Remain in Place Permanently CAYCE, S.C. (Aug. 13, 2026) - Dominion Energy has substantially completed a multiyear restoration project at the Lake Murray dam intake towers. Crews began work in January 2024 to replace headgates inside each of the Saluda Hydroelectric Project’s five intake towers and reconstruct brick enclosures atop each tower. Construction on the towers is now complete and the headgates are operational. “For near",
